{"id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-substitution-modal.md","title":"Modal Substitution","display":"df-substitution-modal — Modal Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-substitution-modal","aliases":["89-df-substitution-modal"],"display":"df-substitution-modal — Modal Substitution","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-substitution-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-substitution-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-modal — Modal Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\bot[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\nq[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\nq,&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\n&amp;&amp;q\\in\\mathrm{Prop},\\\\\n(\\neg A)[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(A[p:=B]),\n&amp;&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\n(A\\land C)[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq A[p:=B]\\land C[p:=B],\n&amp;&amp;A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\n(\\Box A)[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box(A[p:=B]),\n&amp;&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\bot[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\nq[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\nq,&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\n&amp;&amp;q\\in\\mathrm{Prop},\\\\\n(\\neg A)[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(A[p:=B]),\n&amp;&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\n(A\\land C)[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq A[p:=B]\\land C[p:=B],\n&amp;&amp;A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\n(\\Box A)[p:=B]&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box(A[p:=B]),\n&amp;&amp;A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p := B]\">\\(A[p := B]\\)</span> 由结构递归唯一确定；命题模态语言没有变量捕获条件。</li>\n<li>用于构造不动点：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(p)\">\\(A(p)\\)</span>的不动点是满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\leftrightarrow A(B)\">\\(B \\leftrightarrow A(B)\\)</span>的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}$ and $B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see\n[[89-df-modal-formula]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\bot[p:=B]&\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\nq[p:=B]&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&q=p,\\\\\nq,&q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\n&&q\\in\\mathrm{Prop},\\\\\n(\\neg A)[p:=B]&\\coloneqq\\neg(A[p:=B]),\n&&A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\n(A\\land C)[p:=B]&\\coloneqq A[p:=B]\\land C[p:=B],\n&&A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\\\\n(\\Box A)[p:=B]&\\coloneqq\\Box(A[p:=B]),\n&&A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A[p := B]","display":false},{"tex":"A(p)","display":false},{"tex":"B \\leftrightarrow A(B)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1034,"backlinks":[{"id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3cc288e6d7752bb4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A[p:=B]$ is structural modal substitution (see [[89-df-substitution-modal]])."},{"id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb03b454c0564b96","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2d3d18f0211ece52","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}